Hi,

i'd like to rewrite configure for alsa-utils and alsa-tools to use
pkg-config for alsa-lib.  you might have found alsa.pc already in
alsa-lib.
the only concern is that pkg-config is unlikely installed as a
standard tool in most distributions.  but surely pkg-config is the
right way to go.

also, how about to add a define "-DALSA_PCM_NEW_HW_PARAMS_API"
to cflags in alsa.pc, so that the new PCM API is chosen if someone
uses pkg-config ?  there is still alsa.m4 for the older API, so
existing applications don't suffer by this.

any comments please?


Takashi


